    {
      "path": "experiments/shared-renewal-capability/regulation/retention/formation/evolution/README.md",
      "text": "No biological data, evolutionary calibration, innate moral capacity, universal ethical warrant, selection of transmission architecture, or eventual convergence is established. The existing [evaluative succession](../../../../../../theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/EVALUATIVE-SUCCESSION.md) already carries acquired influence to a distinct successor, new evidence and changed selection at its stated scope. The [developmental continuation](development/README.md) now supplies a first finite reconstruction: different contact timings form different operating responses, and the actual consequence supports a further descendant's reconstruction and fresh test. Its 17 new checked declarations retain mistiming, intervention and finite support. Social correspondence, the richer evaluative architecture and ethical calibration remain further connections.\n"
